data: {"id": "4183684a16844033-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "4183684a16844033", "seq": 1281, "ts_ms": 1789142846053, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.479, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1619, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v10/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload in aiops-case-v10 is in CrashLoopBackOff state with exit code 78 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload_aiops-case-v10(d3e0dc86-6f8b-4f29-a50c-826bf2a1f1e6) (over 47m) | 确认 Pod 进入指数退避重启循环 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Last terminated reason: Error; Current waiting reason: CrashLoopBackOff | 确认容器异常终止且当前处于不可用状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | Container app last exit code: 78; Restart count: 14 | 提供具体的异常退出码与重启频次证据 |\n| 4 | Logging | elasticsearch | \"APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing\" | 直接指出容器启动失败的根本原因 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total: 3.0 → 13.0 (47 samples) | 验证重启行为在观察窗口内持续发生 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason (CrashLoopBackOff) & last_terminated_reason (Error) 持续为 1 | 从监控视角确认了持续的异常终止等待状态 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 状态与事件确认了 Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态且容器以 Exit Code 78 异常退出。日志事实直接定位到缺失环境变量 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` 这一启动失败原因。Metric 数据中的重启总数上升趋势与 Kubernetes 的 14 次重启计数及持续报错状态高度一致，佐证了故障的持续性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod spec 中缺失环境变量 APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG → 应用启动脚本检测到配置缺失并报错 → 调用 sys.exit(78) 终止进程 → Kubelet 发现容器退出并触发 CrashLoopBackOff 退避重启循环\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：** 容器应用因启动脚本依赖的环境变量 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` 缺失而显式调用退出（Exit Code 78）。\n\n该配置缺失导致应用启动即终止，Kubernetes 检测到 Exit Code 78 的异常退出后，按照 BackOff 策略反复重启容器，最终导致 Pod 进入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态且状态持续 `ContainersNotReady`。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v10/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload in aiops-case-v10 is in CrashLoopBackOff state with exit code 78 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload_aiops-case-v10(d3e0dc86-6f8b-4f29-a50c-826bf2a1f1e6) (over 47m) | 确认 Pod 进入指数退避重启循环 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Last terminated reason: Error; Current waiting reason: CrashLoopBackOff | 确认容器异常终止且当前处于不可用状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | Container app last exit code: 78; Restart count: 14 | 提供具体的异常退出码与重启频次证据 |\n| 4 | Logging | elasticsearch | \"APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing\" | 直接指出容器启动失败的根本原因 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total: 3.0 → 13.0 (47 samples) | 验证重启行为在观察窗口内持续发生 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason (CrashLoopBackOff) & last_terminated_reason (Error) 持续为 1 | 从监控视角确认了持续的异常终止等待状态 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 状态与事件确认了 Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态且容器以 Exit Code 78 异常退出。日志事实直接定位到缺失环境变量 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` 这一启动失败原因。Metric 数据中的重启总数上升趋势与 Kubernetes 的 14 次重启计数及持续报错状态高度一致，佐证了故障的持续性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod spec 中缺失环境变量 APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG → 应用启动脚本检测到配置缺失并报错 → 调用 sys.exit(78) 终止进程 → Kubelet 发现容器退出并触发 CrashLoopBackOff 退避重启循环\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：** 容器应用因启动脚本依赖的环境变量 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` 缺失而显式调用退出（Exit Code 78）。\n\n该配置缺失导致应用启动即终止，Kubernetes 检测到 Exit Code 78 的异常退出后，按照 BackOff 策略反复重启容器，最终导致 Pod 进入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态且状态持续 `ContainersNotReady`。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "4183684a16844033-final", "run_id": "4183684a16844033", "seq": 1283, "ts_ms": 1789142846068, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v10/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload in aiops-case-v10 is in CrashLoopBackOff state with exit code 78 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload_aiops-case-v10(d3e0dc86-6f8b-4f29-a50c-826bf2a1f1e6) (over 47m) | 确认 Pod 进入指数退避重启循环 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Last terminated reason: Error; Current waiting reason: CrashLoopBackOff | 确认容器异常终止且当前处于不可用状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | Container app last exit code: 78; Restart count: 14 | 提供具体的异常退出码与重启频次证据 |\n| 4 | Logging | elasticsearch | \"APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing\" | 直接指出容器启动失败的根本原因 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total: 3.0 → 13.0 (47 samples) | 验证重启行为在观察窗口内持续发生 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason (CrashLoopBackOff) & last_terminated_reason (Error) 持续为 1 | 从监控视角确认了持续的异常终止等待状态 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 状态与事件确认了 Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态且容器以 Exit Code 78 异常退出。日志事实直接定位到缺失环境变量 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` 这一启动失败原因。Metric 数据中的重启总数上升趋势与 Kubernetes 的 14 次重启计数及持续报错状态高度一致，佐证了故障的持续性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod spec 中缺失环境变量 APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG → 应用启动脚本检测到配置缺失并报错 → 调用 sys.exit(78) 终止进程 → Kubelet 发现容器退出并触发 CrashLoopBackOff 退避重启循环\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：** 容器应用因启动脚本依赖的环境变量 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` 缺失而显式调用退出（Exit Code 78）。\n\n该配置缺失导致应用启动即终止，Kubernetes 检测到 Exit Code 78 的异常退出后，按照 BackOff 策略反复重启容器，最终导致 Pod 进入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态且状态持续 `ContainersNotReady`。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 36.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v10/workload: 36.1s (Evidence 28.7s, RCA 7.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v10/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 66.625, "metrics": {"run_id": "4183684a16844033", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 66.62831425666809, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "53%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 66628.31425666809, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 63709.70916748047, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 6773.697137832642, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2533.7750911712646}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 22018.53775978088